- Relational data modelling across 1 fact table + 4 dimension tables
- PivotTable-driven multi-angle analysis (geography, time, product, customer)
- Conditional aggregation (`SUMIFS`/`COUNTIFS`/`MAXIFS`/`MINIFS`) for segmented KPIs
- Single-screen dashboard layout designed for at-a-glance decision-making

<img width="100%" src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/andreasbm/readme/master/assets/lines/rainbow.png" alt="divider" />

## `07` &nbsp;How to Use

1. Download `Reliance_Trends_Analytics_dashboard.xlsx`
2. Open in **Excel 2016+** (PivotTables and charts are native — no add-ins required)
3. Go to the `dashboard` sheet for the summary view
4. Explore `pivot tables` and `sales values` for the underlying breakdowns
5. Raw data lives in `Sales_data`, `Customers`, `Products`, `Stores`, `Inventory`

